I just threw some color words at jvocu'adju and got the following words:
 25351 xunynajypelri'oblazirnukni
 25840 xu'ernajypelri'oblazirnukni
 25840 xunynajypelri'oblazi'unukni
 26329 xu'ernajypelri'oblazi'unukni
The middle two have the same score. This is nontrivial, since the second has 
an r-hyphen and the third has one more syllable.

